# The arc transcripts: arc*.log is what the script chose to say, and is
# ignored because arc*.stdout is a superset of it -- stdout also carries the
# SDK's own stderr, which is where the two unattributed refusals show up as
# `sim_estimateTransactionFees: execution failed`. That is the evidence the
# refusals were real, so the fuller file is the one kept.
web/arc*.log
